{"w":2400,"h":3106,"lines":[{"y":0.062459755175048426,"h":0.017482105409876381,"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","x":0.56203007208225275,"c":1,"w":0.29511278788248707},{"x":0.080827062795945898,"w":0.33082707722981775,"t":"TEST 4, WRITING TASK 1","c":1,"y":0.11043142280353191,"h":0.020382530521901199},{"x":0.080827070060955603,"w":0.1879699198404948,"y":0.14680232577391428,"t":"SAMPLE ANSWER","h":0.014534883321060788,"c":1},{"w":0.74248118082682291,"c":1,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.5 score. Here is the","x":0.080827078653686796,"h":0.015988372635703185,"y":0.18313953461009036},{"y":0.20057952367173193,"h":0.014536755052751982,"w":0.18984962463378904,"t":"examiner's comment:","x":0.080827067062804764,"c":1},{"y":0.235429601694089,"t":"This answer addresses the main features of the redeveloped sports centre, but it","w":0.70873835245768224,"h":0.020309252963093716,"x":0.12401917308566586,"c":1},{"t":"could be improved by adding a brief description of the centre as it is at present.","y":0.25434642638024307,"w":0.68796991984049483,"h":0.017455899323944313,"x":0.12406015265518798,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.71804509480794265,"t":"Another aspect of the response that could be improved would be to indicate where","x":0.12406015926485224,"h":0.014574192142916553,"y":0.2732558141514374},{"c":1,"y":0.29069767414503167,"x":0.12218045122294731,"h":0.016127824629803889,"t":"the various facilities will be situated in relation to each other: from the description","w":0.70676691691080729},{"c":1,"h":0.01746806619402208,"x":0.12406015229515437,"w":0.72556391398111986,"t":"above the reader cannot know where for example the gym, the leisure pool and the","y":0.30811332910892597},{"t":"dance studios will be located. The range of vocabulary is above average, however:","x":0.12210238637528353,"w":0.72573638916015626,"y":0.32412805142130918,"h":0.020717407147959666,"c":1},{"y":0.34447674405508111,"x":0.12030075866701576,"c":1,"t":"[illustrate | reconstruction | redeveloped | additional | replaced by other facilities","w":0.69360900878906251,"h":0.017441860722175129},{"y":0.36337209274960536,"w":0.67481201171874994,"c":1,"h":0.015988372635703296,"x":0.12030076096094527,"t":"renovated] and shows flexibility and precision. There is a variety of complex"},{"c":1,"x":0.12208097408554769,"y":0.37869634392724638,"t":"structures such as present and future verb forms, passive forms and relative","w":0.66749928792317714,"h":0.020908846981050999},{"y":0.39825581382123199,"t":"clauses [the place where... | It is also clear... that ]. There could be more variety in","x":0.12218045453109369,"h":0.017441860722175129,"w":0.72180450439453125,"c":1},{"y":0.41715116251673667,"w":0.58270675659179683,"x":0.12218045619504191,"h":0.015988372635703185,"t":"the language used to express future plans: [going to] is over-used.","c":1},{"y":0.44331395364073134,"x":0.077067661170150639,"w":0.77255640665690106,"h":0.020348836895119238,"c":1,"t":"The following plans illustrate the layout of the university's sports centre at the present moment and"},{"c":1,"t":"the way it will look after a reconstruction.","x":0.077067669758168242,"y":0.46511627893154806,"h":0.017498015743336759,"w":0.32706766764322914},{"c":1,"t":"According to the new layout, the redeveloped sports centre is going to become bigger. First, the","y":0.49259497802700114,"w":0.74248118082682291,"x":0.078947379280104243,"h":0.020605279488941086},{"y":0.51308139530244046,"t":"gym is going to be larger and an additional changing room is going to appear. Besides, there is","x":0.078947376522678872,"w":0.74248118082682291,"h":0.020402184932829082,"c":1},{"h":0.019007659465055338,"c":1,"y":0.53477141028525976,"t":"going to be a sports shop and a cafe in the reception zone. Apart from that, 2 dance studios are","w":0.74812032063802092,"x":0.078947358386261796},{"x":0.078872011472802608,"t":"going to work opposite the gym. Finally, the sports centre is going to get a new leisure pool. It is","y":0.55441868650611448,"w":0.74826324462890625,"c":1,"h":0.022023066504110567},{"x":0.078771284549972717,"y":0.57211758800293178,"w":0.73712061564127607,"c":1,"t":"going to be located in the place where the outdoor courts used to be. As can be seen from the","h":0.024063903749641624},{"x":0.077067666781268349,"w":0.76879699707031257,"y":0.59723116559778711,"h":0.01904790415275659,"t":"new layout, both outdoor courts are going to be replaced by other facilities in the renovated sports","c":1},{"h":0.018895348808647183,"w":0.76879699707031257,"t":"centre. Furthermore, a sports hall is going to appear in the university sports centre. It is also clear","x":0.077067666580902305,"c":1,"y":0.61773255814514827},{"h":0.022929852959116426,"y":0.63656117635223386,"w":0.71453908284505208,"c":1,"t":"from the second layout that the redeveloped sports centre is going to be a fully indoor one.","x":0.076942682576227051},{"x":0.8139097741663045,"y":0.94331395348603531,"w":0.03571428616841632,"h":0.013081395234588844,"t":"133","c":1}]}